1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 24=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:44,540 --> 00:01:46,380
(Zhenhuai Gate)

7
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,040
Hyah!

8
00:02:04,220 --> 00:02:08,020
♪If there were a promise♪

9
00:02:08,460 --> 00:02:12,380
♪Could I still refuse with a smile?♪

10
00:02:12,740 --> 00:02:16,260
♪Sadly, things did not go as I wished♪

11
00:02:17,180 --> 00:02:20,580
♪Yet I still
have to smile through it all♪

12
00:02:20,900 --> 00:02:23,060
♪Those things I cannot forget♪

13
00:02:23,060 --> 00:02:27,380
♪The absurdities
I cannot let go of fill the pages♪

14
00:02:27,380 --> 00:02:29,340
♪Building a wall♪

15
00:02:29,340 --> 00:02:33,100
♪Trapping me in the midst of time♪

16
00:02:33,448 --> 00:02:34,980
(Order of the Commander
of the Shence Garrison)

17
00:02:34,980 --> 00:02:36,820
♪Drifting with the wind♪

18
00:02:37,300 --> 00:02:41,740
♪Etched upon my heart♪

19
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:50,400
- Hurry!
- Quickly!

20
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,630
(Qingyan House)
Hurry!

21
00:03:01,420 --> 00:03:04,980
(Intoxicated Moon in the Mist)

22
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:06,680
Young Master.

23
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:09,680
All the young ladies here are present.

24
00:04:00,439 --> 00:04:03,039
The young lady you're looking
for ran away long ago.

25
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,000
Look, Young Master.

26
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,680
Just to find her,

27
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,120
I sent almost all

28
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:09,919
the guards out searching.

29
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:12,120
Only we women are left here.

30
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:13,919
Young Master.

31
00:04:14,328 --> 00:04:15,430
We've searched everywhere.

32
00:04:15,430 --> 00:04:16,670
We couldn't find Young Lady Xu.

33
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:17,990
While I was keeping watch outside,

34
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:19,896
I heard them shouting
that she had escaped.

35
00:04:20,280 --> 00:04:21,430
I saw the brothel servants

36
00:04:21,448 --> 00:04:23,144
leave with the guards to search for her.

37
00:04:31,079 --> 00:04:32,079
What

38
00:04:33,639 --> 00:04:34,879
did you do to her?

39
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:40,000
That young lady is even better
at sweet-talking than a man.

40
00:04:40,759 --> 00:04:42,680
She said she was a rare prize

41
00:04:42,728 --> 00:04:44,560
and that I should
wait for the highest offer,

42
00:04:44,639 --> 00:04:46,279
promising to make me a fortune.

43
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:48,519
She had me completely delighted.

44
00:04:48,959 --> 00:04:51,199
I gave her the best food
and drink for a whole day.

45
00:04:51,199 --> 00:04:52,040
But when I

46
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:54,519
invited all
the wealthy merchants in Yangzhou,

47
00:04:54,519 --> 00:04:55,959
she actually ran away.

48
00:05:05,639 --> 00:05:07,040
Didn't you send guards after her?

49
00:05:07,192 --> 00:05:08,070
Did they catch her?

50
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:09,439
Young Master.

51
00:05:10,319 --> 00:05:12,519
That young lady
is as slippery as an eel.

52
00:05:12,959 --> 00:05:14,920
She's probably long gone from the city.

53
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,199
If you're looking for her,

54
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:19,519
you might want
to ask the local authorities.

55
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:20,920
She has no travel permit,

56
00:05:21,279 --> 00:05:22,399
so she can't board a boat

57
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:23,920
or take a carriage.

58
00:05:24,519 --> 00:05:25,800
Chances are

59
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:28,399
the constables will catch her
and bring her back.

60
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:30,680
You should be grateful

61
00:05:31,199 --> 00:05:32,079
that she escaped.

62
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:36,519
Take care, Young Master.

63
00:05:41,519 --> 00:05:42,199
Young Lady.

64
00:05:44,399 --> 00:05:45,079
Young Lady.

65
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:49,040
Because of him,

66
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:51,680
I've ended up like this,

67
00:05:54,639 --> 00:05:56,040
yet he doesn't even remember

68
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:56,879
what I look like.

69
00:06:02,639 --> 00:06:04,319
He doesn't remember who I am at all.

70
00:06:18,759 --> 00:06:19,519
Young Lady.

71
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,560
Young Lady Shuang.

72
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:38,920
You betrayed me first,

73
00:06:40,079 --> 00:06:42,800
so don't blame me
for turning against you.

74
00:07:18,488 --> 00:07:20,630
Without a travel permit,
she can't board a boat.

75
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:22,160
She should be easy to find.

76
00:07:23,319 --> 00:07:24,439
Once we get the reward,

77
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:27,040
let's go drink at Qingyan House.

78
00:07:40,264 --> 00:07:42,510
If someone without
a travel permit tries to board a boat,

79
00:07:42,776 --> 00:07:44,240
report it to the authorities at once.

80
00:07:44,408 --> 00:07:45,928
There's a reward for reporting them.

81
00:07:46,439 --> 00:07:47,600
- All right.
- Sure!

82
00:07:56,879 --> 00:08:04,279
♪Who dares predict
tomorrow's rain or shine?♪

83
00:08:04,439 --> 00:08:07,800
♪A sudden clap of spring thunder♪

84
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:11,439
♪With wealth and children♪

85
00:08:11,839 --> 00:08:17,399
♪Free from trouble and strife♪

86
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:23,199
♪Who dares say?♪

87
00:08:23,519 --> 00:08:31,720
♪No one dares say♪

88
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:41,799
♪No one dares say♪

89
00:09:17,559 --> 00:09:19,679
Scholar Han, Furong.

90
00:09:20,159 --> 00:09:21,399
Why are you here?

91
00:09:23,679 --> 00:09:25,039
We came to take you home.

92
00:10:00,799 --> 00:10:02,519
I knew a clever girl like you

93
00:10:02,679 --> 00:10:04,440
would find a way out of danger.

94
00:10:07,919 --> 00:10:09,559
How did you know I was in Yangzhou?

95
00:10:10,039 --> 00:10:11,320
Commander Lin found out

96
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:13,919
that this misfortune
befell you because of him.

97
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:16,740
He also said the person behind it was
beyond even his power to confront.

98
00:10:16,759 --> 00:10:17,919
So I went to Furong

99
00:10:18,168 --> 00:10:19,960
to ask about
the powerful and influential.

100
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:22,744
There are always plenty
of people talking at the theater,

101
00:10:22,776 --> 00:10:24,888
and our troupe often
performs at private residences.

102
00:10:25,159 --> 00:10:26,159
If we pay attention,

103
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:28,200
we can learn a great deal.

104
00:10:28,904 --> 00:10:30,968
Recently, the young lady
of Duke Xianguo's family

105
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,910
has been discussing marriage
with Commander Lin.

106
00:10:33,399 --> 00:10:35,679
That matched what happened to you.

107
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:38,919
Once we knew the person who harmed you

108
00:10:38,920 --> 00:10:40,904
was the young lady
of Duke Xianguo's family,

109
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:43,679
we could guess what she intended to do.

110
00:10:44,759 --> 00:10:45,679
The closest places

111
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:48,639
to Jinling are Yangzhou Prefecture
and Zhenjiang Prefecture.

112
00:10:49,799 --> 00:10:50,919
After discussing it,

113
00:10:51,399 --> 00:10:52,440
Furong and I

114
00:10:52,552 --> 00:10:54,184
came to Yangzhou to look for you.

115
00:10:54,559 --> 00:10:55,840
Mister Lu and Uncle Xu

116
00:10:55,992 --> 00:10:57,448
went to Zhenjiang to look for you.

117
00:11:00,232 --> 00:11:02,510
You've both gone to
a lot of trouble for me this time.

118
00:11:04,399 --> 00:11:05,440
Scholar Han

119
00:11:06,039 --> 00:11:07,679
especially went to great lengths.

120
00:11:12,399 --> 00:11:13,320
Our families

121
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:14,750
live next door to each other

122
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:17,039
and have always been as close as family.

123
00:11:17,639 --> 00:11:19,799
We're family, so there's no need
for such formalities.

124
00:11:21,799 --> 00:11:22,320
All right.

125
00:11:23,159 --> 00:11:25,279
I won't stand on ceremony, then.

126
00:11:35,919 --> 00:11:38,320
This Young Lady Zheng is rather strange.

127
00:11:38,919 --> 00:11:40,519
She's never even met you.

128
00:11:40,679 --> 00:11:42,320
Why would she resent you so much?

129
00:11:44,919 --> 00:11:47,440
I just heard
your father call you Lanxiang.

130
00:11:49,039 --> 00:11:51,159
I imagine this orchid
has some connection to you.

131
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:53,600
Won't you miss it?

132
00:11:55,799 --> 00:11:57,039
We did meet once.

133
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:59,320
I'm afraid
there was some misunderstanding.

134
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:02,159
She mistakenly thought I was standing
in the way of her marriage.

135
00:12:05,064 --> 00:12:06,584
Even if there was a misunderstanding,

136
00:12:06,590 --> 00:12:08,390
she should have taken it up
with Commander Lin.

137
00:12:08,399 --> 00:12:09,879
What right did she have to frame you?

138
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,559
She relies on her wealth and power

139
00:12:11,624 --> 00:12:13,512
and treats us
all like insects beneath her feet,

140
00:12:13,520 --> 00:12:15,816
trampling on us as she pleases.
It's truly infuriating.

141
00:12:16,759 --> 00:12:17,559
That day,

142
00:12:17,559 --> 00:12:19,559
if something had really
happened to you on stage,

143
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:21,399
our troupe would've been finished.

144
00:12:21,768 --> 00:12:23,270
Taking away someone's livelihood

145
00:12:23,304 --> 00:12:25,000
is no different from taking their life.

146
00:12:26,039 --> 00:12:28,399
Fortunately, Lanxiang
thought quickly on her feet.

147
00:12:28,679 --> 00:12:31,039
Otherwise, my reputation
would've been completely ruined,

148
00:12:31,799 --> 00:12:34,559
and I would've had no chance
of an official career ever again.

149
00:12:36,232 --> 00:12:39,000
They say yielding a step
opens up a world of possibilities.

150
00:12:40,159 --> 00:12:41,399
But this Young Lady Zheng

151
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:43,279
has gone far too far

152
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:45,519
and left us nowhere to retreat.

153
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,759
We can't just let this go.

154
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:59,039
We have to seek justice.

155
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:01,720
We have neither power nor influence.

156
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:05,080
How can we seek justice
from a duke's daughter?

157
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:09,559
Don't they say justice
lives in people's hearts?

158
00:13:10,039 --> 00:13:12,440
If the authorities
won't uphold justice for us,

159
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:13,440
then we

160
00:13:14,168 --> 00:13:15,790
will ask the people what they think.

161
00:13:17,559 --> 00:13:19,759
Ask the people?

162
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:43,559
Slow down.

163
00:13:43,559 --> 00:13:44,799
You'll choke.

164
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:03,120
Have some tea.

165
00:14:07,519 --> 00:14:08,279
Here.

166
00:14:09,559 --> 00:14:11,440
Take your time. There's more in the pot.

167
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:31,279
Mother.

168
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:34,039
How much money do we have left?

169
00:14:34,759 --> 00:14:35,720
You need money?

170
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:39,559
If Ji'er hadn't saved me,

171
00:14:40,559 --> 00:14:41,879
I never would've escaped.

172
00:14:42,799 --> 00:14:43,759
I promised her

173
00:14:44,039 --> 00:14:45,559
I'd go back and buy her freedom.

174
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:50,200
Three hundred and eighty taels.

175
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,200
Is that enough?

176
00:14:53,799 --> 00:14:54,600
No.

177
00:14:54,872 --> 00:14:56,600
We'll need at least five hundred taels.

178
00:15:01,879 --> 00:15:02,720
Don't worry.

179
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:06,456
Wait until your father and Mister Lu

180
00:15:06,460 --> 00:15:08,600
return from Zhenjiang Prefecture
in a couple of days.

181
00:15:08,799 --> 00:15:10,440
We'll find a way to borrow some.

182
00:15:11,799 --> 00:15:12,840
Don't worry.

183
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:14,879
Ji'er saved you.

184
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:17,200
Even if we have
to sell everything we own,

185
00:15:17,519 --> 00:15:19,000
we'll get her out too.

186
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:23,559
Once

187
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:26,039
we get Ji'er out,

188
00:15:27,039 --> 00:15:28,759
if she wants to find her parents

189
00:15:28,799 --> 00:15:29,960
and her younger brother,

190
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:32,120
we'll help her look for them.

191
00:15:34,559 --> 00:15:35,639
If she doesn't,

192
00:15:36,039 --> 00:15:37,279
she can stay

193
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:38,600
and be my daughter.

194
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:40,000
You two can be sisters

195
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:41,240
and keep each other company.

196
00:15:43,080 --> 00:15:43,759
All right.

197
00:15:43,879 --> 00:15:45,240
We'll do as you say, Mother.

198
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:49,600
I'll get you another bowl of rice.

199
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:51,279
I'm full.

200
00:15:51,280 --> 00:15:52,792
I'll be stuffed if I eat any more.

201
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:54,279
Really!

202
00:15:54,279 --> 00:15:55,440
Leave it. I'll do it.

203
00:15:55,559 --> 00:15:56,039
Sit here.

204
00:15:56,039 --> 00:15:57,120
Drink your tea.

205
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:21,039
What is it?

206
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:41,799
Furong said

207
00:16:42,639 --> 00:16:44,279
the star courtesans in Yangzhou City

208
00:16:44,559 --> 00:16:45,559
don't come cheap.

209
00:16:45,992 --> 00:16:47,496
This is the money my sister and I

210
00:16:47,879 --> 00:16:49,360
pooled together with Furong.

211
00:16:49,799 --> 00:16:50,799
Take it for now.

212
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:55,039
Saving her comes first.

213
00:16:55,039 --> 00:16:56,279
You can pay us back slowly.

214
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:01,279
Mother and I

215
00:17:01,279 --> 00:17:03,080
were just talking about borrowing money,

216
00:17:03,360 --> 00:17:04,759
and now you've brought us some.

217
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,440
Then I won't stand on ceremony.

218
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:12,039
I'll take it for now.

219
00:17:24,559 --> 00:17:25,440
Wait.

220
00:17:42,119 --> 00:17:43,359
I'll go put it somewhere safe.

221
00:17:43,519 --> 00:17:44,079
All right.

222
00:17:46,504 --> 00:17:47,790
I'll take this to the kitchen.

223
00:17:47,790 --> 00:17:49,590
We can eat it together
when Mother gets back.

224
00:17:55,559 --> 00:17:58,079
Furong asked me to tell you something.

225
00:17:59,559 --> 00:18:00,880
At a place like Qingyan House,

226
00:18:00,936 --> 00:18:03,480
it would be difficult for a young lady
like you to handle things,

227
00:18:04,360 --> 00:18:06,584
especially since you've
already crossed the madam.

228
00:18:07,039 --> 00:18:08,519
You might only make matters worse.

229
00:18:09,272 --> 00:18:10,960
It's better to wait
for Uncle Xu to return

230
00:18:11,319 --> 00:18:13,799
and have him
go to Yangzhou with Mister Lu.

231
00:18:14,559 --> 00:18:15,960
With Scholar Zongbai's reputation,

232
00:18:16,440 --> 00:18:17,720
they'll surely be able to bring

233
00:18:17,759 --> 00:18:18,640
your savior back.

234
00:18:23,039 --> 00:18:24,599
Furong has a point.

235
00:18:25,279 --> 00:18:26,759
It would be safer

236
00:18:26,904 --> 00:18:28,472
for Mister Lu and my father to go.

237
00:18:32,759 --> 00:18:33,759
Have you decided

238
00:18:34,376 --> 00:18:36,030
what to do about Young Lady Zheng?

239
00:18:57,640 --> 00:19:10,119
♪Turning right and wrong upside down♪

240
00:19:10,240 --> 00:19:18,519
♪Doing evil without restraint♪

241
00:19:18,680 --> 00:19:25,359
♪You make a mockery of the law♪

242
00:19:25,759 --> 00:19:36,079
♪You corrupt all moral order♪

243
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:49,279
♪My Lord, do not believe
these slanderous words♪

244
00:19:49,279 --> 00:19:51,460
♪My thoughts are like a red umbrella♪

245
00:19:51,980 --> 00:19:54,060
♪Drifting through the rain♪

246
00:19:54,420 --> 00:19:59,500
♪Held tightly in my hand,
shielding me from hidden currents♪

247
00:19:59,500 --> 00:20:04,580
♪Yet fate stains my sleeves with blood♪

248
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:09,800
Young Master, aren't you
going in to see Lanxiang?

249
00:20:09,912 --> 00:20:11,200
Chengze is still waiting for me.

250
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:13,112
Let's take care
of the important matter first.

251
00:20:15,839 --> 00:20:20,200
♪Fabricating lies to ruin her good name♪

252
00:20:20,839 --> 00:20:27,200
♪Killing without spilling
a drop of blood♪

253
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:33,300
♪I'd spend this life
and call it courage♪

254
00:20:39,559 --> 00:20:43,680
♪My Lord, uphold justice♪

255
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:50,279
♪Tell right from wrong
and judge what is just♪

256
00:20:52,039 --> 00:20:52,839
Well said!

257
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:04,559
I've made up my mind.

258
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:10,200
For Marquis Yongchang's wedding,

259
00:21:10,440 --> 00:21:12,960
was Furong invited to perform
The Tale of the Treasure Chest?

260
00:21:13,799 --> 00:21:14,359
Yes.

261
00:21:15,039 --> 00:21:16,559
The Crown Prince enjoys opera,

262
00:21:17,279 --> 00:21:19,759
especially popular plays
about everyday life.

263
00:21:20,312 --> 00:21:22,790
So Marquis Yongchang
chose The Tale of the Treasure Chest

264
00:21:23,039 --> 00:21:24,119
for the Crown Prince.

265
00:21:25,079 --> 00:21:27,799
I hear many nobles want
to go to Marquis Yongchang's Residence

266
00:21:28,559 --> 00:21:30,039
just to see the play.

267
00:21:32,519 --> 00:21:33,359
Perfect.

268
00:21:34,559 --> 00:21:35,799
Then we'll

269
00:21:36,559 --> 00:21:39,599
use the play to stage a play of our own.

270
00:21:42,552 --> 00:21:44,200
Use the play to stage a play of our own?

271
00:22:04,559 --> 00:22:06,440
Once we bring Ji'er back,

272
00:22:07,279 --> 00:22:08,839
I should talk to Madam Han again

273
00:22:08,839 --> 00:22:10,680
about the marriage between those two.

274
00:22:23,060 --> 00:22:26,460
(Marquis Yongchang's Residence)

275
00:22:41,740 --> 00:22:44,860
♪In spring, my heart
sets out filled with hope♪

276
00:22:44,860 --> 00:22:46,620
♪For all the tenderness in this world♪

277
00:22:48,960 --> 00:22:52,000
Please have the bride
and groom drink the nuptial wine.

278
00:22:54,599 --> 00:22:55,440
Please.

279
00:22:56,839 --> 00:22:57,359
Please.

280
00:22:57,359 --> 00:22:59,900
♪Though summer brings
its share of hardships♪

281
00:22:59,900 --> 00:23:01,940
♪I still struggle
through the wind and rain♪

282
00:23:01,940 --> 00:23:03,660
♪My spirit remains undaunted♪

283
00:23:04,020 --> 00:23:07,180
♪Daring to press on, daring to fight♪

284
00:23:07,580 --> 00:23:09,980
♪Riding with the wind♪

285
00:23:10,079 --> 00:23:11,039
What's this?

286
00:23:11,624 --> 00:23:13,416
Dates and chestnuts.
[*Have a child early.]

287
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:17,319
First, scatter the fruits.

288
00:23:18,119 --> 00:23:20,880
May the newlyweds
share a blissful bridal chamber.

289
00:23:23,799 --> 00:23:25,119
Second, scatter the fruits.

290
00:23:26,559 --> 00:23:29,240
May two red candles shine
upon the loving pair.

291
00:23:30,720 --> 00:23:32,039
Third, scatter the fruits.

292
00:23:32,519 --> 00:23:34,880
May three cups of fine wine
be raised to the groom.

293
00:23:36,200 --> 00:23:37,519
Fourth, scatter the fruits.

294
00:23:38,279 --> 00:23:41,279
May the flowered bridal sedan
carry the bride to her new home.

295
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:44,839
Fifth, scatter the fruits.

296
00:23:45,119 --> 00:23:48,000
May five worthy sons achieve honors
in the imperial examinations.

297
00:23:51,799 --> 00:23:53,240
Sixth, scatter the fruits.

298
00:23:53,720 --> 00:23:56,480
May you rise to greatness
like Su Qin, who served the six states.

299
00:23:59,559 --> 00:24:00,799
Seventh, scatter the fruits.

300
00:24:01,799 --> 00:24:04,440
May seven celestial maidens
accompany the bride.

301
00:24:05,079 --> 00:24:06,519
Eighth, scatter the fruits.

302
00:24:06,880 --> 00:24:09,440
May the Eight Immortals
bring blessings to your home.

303
00:24:10,079 --> 00:24:11,519
Ninth, scatter the fruits.

304
00:24:11,640 --> 00:24:14,279
May nine generations
live together in harmony.

305
00:24:14,559 --> 00:24:16,079
Tenth, scatter the fruits.

306
00:24:16,880 --> 00:24:20,039
May ten generations of descendants
serve and safeguard the realm.

307
00:24:21,039 --> 00:24:22,799
May Your Lordship and your wife

308
00:24:22,880 --> 00:24:24,079
share a loving marriage

309
00:24:24,079 --> 00:24:26,240
and grow old together.

310
00:24:26,344 --> 00:24:28,200
- A loving marriage.
- A loving marriage.

311
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:29,960
- Grow old together.
- Grow old together.

312
00:24:43,039 --> 00:24:43,519
My Lady.

313
00:24:43,960 --> 00:24:44,920
Get some rest.

314
00:24:45,288 --> 00:24:46,440
I'll go see to the guests.

315
00:24:47,880 --> 00:24:49,079
Go ahead, Your Lordship.

316
00:25:12,584 --> 00:25:14,632
Just as Your Lordship
and Young Master Lin expected,

317
00:25:14,648 --> 00:25:16,340
Duke Xianguo chose
to make his move today.

318
00:25:16,350 --> 00:25:18,260
He has stationed
a large force outside the residence.

319
00:25:18,270 --> 00:25:20,568
It looks like he has no intention
of letting the Crown Prince

320
00:25:20,570 --> 00:25:21,650
leave the residence alive.

321
00:25:22,240 --> 00:25:23,359
Does Fengtai know?

322
00:25:23,799 --> 00:25:24,599
Yes.

323
00:25:26,880 --> 00:25:27,559
♪My Lord♪

324
00:25:28,039 --> 00:25:29,119
♪Let me tell you instead♪

325
00:25:29,359 --> 00:25:30,279
♪Her name is Tanniang♪

326
00:25:30,319 --> 00:25:31,319
♪She's a widow♪

327
00:25:31,320 --> 00:25:33,480
♪She should have remained
faithful to her late husband♪

328
00:25:33,496 --> 00:25:34,960
♪Yet she tried to seduce me♪

329
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:36,170
♪But I refused her advances♪

330
00:25:36,279 --> 00:25:37,200
♪Who would've thought♪

331
00:25:37,400 --> 00:25:39,240
♪She would set
her sights on my treasure♪

332
00:25:39,400 --> 00:25:41,680
♪My pearl-threaded golden robe♪

333
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:43,920
♪My Lord, utter nonsense♪

334
00:25:44,079 --> 00:25:46,279
♪He tried to force himself on me♪

335
00:25:46,279 --> 00:25:47,799
♪But I refused♪

336
00:25:47,799 --> 00:25:50,960
♪So this scoundrel held a grudge♪

337
00:25:50,960 --> 00:25:53,680
♪When one scheme failed,
he devised another♪

338
00:25:53,799 --> 00:25:56,359
♪And tried to frame me♪

339
00:25:58,440 --> 00:26:01,599
♪This is a court of law.
I will not tolerate such insolence!♪

340
00:26:01,640 --> 00:26:03,039
♪Guards♪

341
00:26:03,039 --> 00:26:05,200
♪Open the chest at once♪

342
00:26:05,200 --> 00:26:08,039
♪And let me examine it carefully♪

343
00:26:08,240 --> 00:26:10,519
♪To see if there are any clothes inside♪

344
00:26:10,519 --> 00:26:11,039
♪There are♪

345
00:26:11,039 --> 00:26:12,200
♪There are none♪

346
00:26:12,359 --> 00:26:14,839
♪Why should anyone believe
this wretched woman's words?♪

347
00:26:14,920 --> 00:26:17,400
♪Curse Guo Qiu, you vile beast♪

348
00:26:17,400 --> 00:26:19,559
♪You vile beast♪

349
00:26:29,912 --> 00:26:32,540
(Chen Shaoxin, Yuan Shaohui's Mother,
Old Madam of the Yuan Family)

350
00:26:32,540 --> 00:26:34,744
(Yuan Jiarong, Yuan Shaohui's
Eldest Daughter, Age Twelve)

351
00:26:36,880 --> 00:26:39,440
Manyi, you've
always lived in the capital.

352
00:26:39,544 --> 00:26:41,960
You're accustomed to refined
northern opera and court music.

353
00:26:42,319 --> 00:26:44,440
Can you get used to

354
00:26:44,440 --> 00:26:45,759
our more popular southern opera?

355
00:26:47,440 --> 00:26:48,799
I was born in Jinling.

356
00:26:48,799 --> 00:26:50,039
Why wouldn't I be used to it?

357
00:26:50,519 --> 00:26:52,319
Besides, Emperor Shengzu once said

358
00:26:52,599 --> 00:26:54,240
Gao Ming's The Story of the Lute

359
00:26:54,240 --> 00:26:55,559
is like the finest delicacies,

360
00:26:55,592 --> 00:26:57,480
something no noble household
should be without.

361
00:26:58,599 --> 00:27:01,000
Clearly, neither northern
nor southern opera is superior.

362
00:27:01,200 --> 00:27:03,319
It all depends on
the skill of the playwright.

363
00:27:04,584 --> 00:27:06,504
Take The Tale
of the Treasure Chest before us.

364
00:27:06,799 --> 00:27:08,039
It was written by Lu Zongbai.

365
00:27:08,440 --> 00:27:09,559
Its lyrics are elegant,

366
00:27:09,656 --> 00:27:11,640
which is why it belongs
on the finest stages.

367
00:27:13,599 --> 00:27:14,720
Just look

368
00:27:16,200 --> 00:27:20,000
at her bearing, speech,
and breadth of knowledge.

369
00:27:20,440 --> 00:27:22,720
As expected
of someone raised in the palace.

370
00:27:23,200 --> 00:27:24,880
Old Madam is quite right.

371
00:27:25,640 --> 00:27:27,000
A young lady like Manyi

372
00:27:27,240 --> 00:27:29,599
is what a truly
well-bred young lady should be.

373
00:27:32,319 --> 00:27:33,640
You flatter her, Old Madam.

374
00:27:33,832 --> 00:27:36,030
It's all thanks
to Dowager Consort Zheng's guidance.

375
00:27:38,880 --> 00:27:42,640
♪Fabricating lies to ruin her good name♪

376
00:27:43,240 --> 00:27:49,720
♪Killing without
spilling a drop of blood♪

377
00:28:04,344 --> 00:28:05,110
Your Highness.

378
00:28:05,559 --> 00:28:06,200
I arrived late.

379
00:28:06,319 --> 00:28:08,000
Today is your wedding day.

380
00:28:08,088 --> 00:28:09,240
No need for formalities.

381
00:28:10,960 --> 00:28:11,599
Chengze.

382
00:28:12,119 --> 00:28:14,319
You should offer
your brother-in-law a proper toast.

383
00:28:15,799 --> 00:28:16,839
You weren't here earlier.

384
00:28:17,000 --> 00:28:18,920
He was the one
helping receive the guests.

385
00:28:21,279 --> 00:28:22,519
I shall obey Your Highness.

386
00:28:24,720 --> 00:28:27,039
Commander Lin is a few years
younger than the Marquis,

387
00:28:27,144 --> 00:28:28,840
yet now he's become his brother-in-law.

388
00:28:36,552 --> 00:28:37,960
Thank you for your help today.

389
00:28:39,200 --> 00:28:40,799
We're family. It's only right.

390
00:28:41,480 --> 00:28:43,559
♪If everything she says is true♪

391
00:28:43,559 --> 00:28:47,319
♪I beg you to find him guilty♪

392
00:28:47,880 --> 00:28:48,440
♪My Lord♪

393
00:28:48,880 --> 00:28:50,079
♪Find her guilty♪

394
00:28:50,279 --> 00:28:53,480
♪Say no more. One look will tell♪

395
00:28:53,640 --> 00:28:54,799
♪- Guards
- Yes♪

396
00:28:54,799 --> 00:28:56,839
♪Open the chest at once♪

397
00:28:56,839 --> 00:28:57,440
♪Good♪

398
00:29:26,480 --> 00:29:35,799
- Good!
- Good!

399
00:29:38,319 --> 00:29:41,200
♪There's a ghost in the chest♪

400
00:29:41,720 --> 00:29:44,599
♪There's a ghost in the chest♪

401
00:29:44,839 --> 00:29:48,240
♪There's a ghost in the chest♪

402
00:30:12,000 --> 00:30:12,680
Manyi.

403
00:30:17,736 --> 00:30:19,160
What a wonderful performance.

404
00:30:19,599 --> 00:30:21,359
I simply couldn't help myself.

405
00:30:23,519 --> 00:30:24,319
Forgive my manners.

406
00:30:29,920 --> 00:30:30,599
What's wrong?

407
00:30:31,599 --> 00:30:33,039
There's a ghost in the play.

408
00:30:36,720 --> 00:30:38,559
I have to go catch the ghost.

409
00:30:52,319 --> 00:30:53,519
So it really is Young Lady Xu.

410
00:30:56,880 --> 00:30:58,079
I should've known.

411
00:30:59,480 --> 00:31:01,400
She's not one
to let others mistreat her.

412
00:31:07,384 --> 00:31:08,830
I'll have to trouble you, Chengze.

413
00:31:09,599 --> 00:31:10,880
Make sure she stays safe.

414
00:31:14,039 --> 00:31:14,480
All right.

415
00:31:28,264 --> 00:31:29,030
Your Highness.

416
00:31:29,528 --> 00:31:30,960
After escorting the bride here,

417
00:31:30,970 --> 00:31:33,070
we must return and report
to our parents and elders,

418
00:31:33,112 --> 00:31:34,980
and inform our ancestors
at the ancestral hall.

419
00:31:35,016 --> 00:31:36,440
So we must take our leave first

420
00:31:36,720 --> 00:31:38,400
and cannot remain
at Your Highness's side.

421
00:31:38,488 --> 00:31:39,880
Please forgive us, Your Highness.

422
00:31:42,568 --> 00:31:43,990
Those are our ancestral family rules.

423
00:31:44,200 --> 00:31:45,240
It's only right.

424
00:31:45,799 --> 00:31:46,599
You may go.

425
00:31:48,039 --> 00:31:48,640
Yes.

426
00:31:55,240 --> 00:31:55,960
♪Guards♪

427
00:31:56,200 --> 00:32:00,359
♪Take this guilty woman
and throw her in jail♪

428
00:32:06,079 --> 00:32:13,559
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

429
00:32:18,640 --> 00:32:19,319
Chengze.

430
00:32:19,839 --> 00:32:20,920
Make the arrangements.

431
00:32:21,599 --> 00:32:22,839
I want to take the stage

432
00:32:23,112 --> 00:32:25,016
and play the Mountain Deity
who upholds justice

433
00:32:25,032 --> 00:32:27,070
in the final act
of The Tale of the Treasure Chest.

434
00:32:30,039 --> 00:32:30,640
Your Highness.

435
00:32:31,200 --> 00:32:33,559
I don't think this is appropriate.

436
00:32:37,960 --> 00:32:38,680
Duke Xianguo.

437
00:32:39,720 --> 00:32:40,640
What do you think?

438
00:32:42,599 --> 00:32:43,440
I...

439
00:32:43,992 --> 00:32:45,350
also think it's inappropriate.

440
00:32:47,359 --> 00:32:49,160
I'll be playing a deity onstage.

441
00:32:49,208 --> 00:32:51,350
That doesn't violate
Emperor Shengzu's teachings.

442
00:32:51,512 --> 00:32:52,680
What's inappropriate about it?

443
00:32:54,888 --> 00:32:55,510
Your Highness...

444
00:32:55,519 --> 00:32:56,480
This is a rare occasion.

445
00:32:56,880 --> 00:32:58,000
My mind is made up.

446
00:32:58,184 --> 00:32:59,590
If you try to dissuade me again,

447
00:33:00,440 --> 00:33:01,640
I'll return to the palace.

448
00:33:03,592 --> 00:33:04,750
On this joyous occasion,

449
00:33:04,760 --> 00:33:06,990
it's rare for the Crown Prince
to be in such high spirits.

450
00:33:07,480 --> 00:33:09,559
We wouldn't dare spoil your enjoyment.

451
00:33:13,119 --> 00:33:13,839
Chengze.

452
00:33:15,319 --> 00:33:16,920
Even Duke Xianguo has agreed.

453
00:33:20,264 --> 00:33:21,720
I'll make the arrangements at once.

454
00:33:37,160 --> 00:33:37,839
Your Highness.

455
00:33:38,119 --> 00:33:40,039
It's just around the corner.

456
00:33:45,112 --> 00:33:46,960
With so many people watching the play,

457
00:33:47,112 --> 00:33:48,552
why are you the only one who thinks

458
00:33:48,584 --> 00:33:50,680
I was pretending
to be a ghost to frighten you?

459
00:33:51,759 --> 00:33:53,599
There's an old saying.

460
00:33:54,160 --> 00:33:55,680
If you've done nothing wrong,

461
00:33:55,750 --> 00:33:57,976
you needn't fear
a ghost knocking at midnight.

462
00:33:58,720 --> 00:34:00,519
If you had nothing to hide,

463
00:34:02,280 --> 00:34:04,720
why would you be afraid
of me pretending to be a ghost?

464
00:34:07,599 --> 00:34:10,079
There's another old
saying that's even better.

465
00:34:10,519 --> 00:34:12,719
Money can make
even a ghost turn a millstone.

466
00:34:13,920 --> 00:34:15,519
I have wealth and power.

467
00:34:15,760 --> 00:34:17,320
I can catch ghosts and destroy them,

468
00:34:17,496 --> 00:34:19,230
even make them
turn the millstones for me.

469
00:34:20,239 --> 00:34:21,199
But you...

470
00:34:26,239 --> 00:34:27,840
can only be a ghost.

471
00:34:34,320 --> 00:34:36,400
I refuse to believe
there is no law in this land.

472
00:34:37,320 --> 00:34:38,519
Scholar Han said

473
00:34:39,079 --> 00:34:40,559
you sent men to abduct me

474
00:34:40,719 --> 00:34:42,320
and are suspected of human trafficking.

475
00:34:42,320 --> 00:34:43,880
You've violated the laws of our dynasty.

476
00:34:44,239 --> 00:34:45,400
It's a serious crime.

477
00:34:45,840 --> 00:34:47,320
Rites do not extend to commoners,

478
00:34:47,848 --> 00:34:49,590
and punishments do not reach officials.

479
00:34:50,519 --> 00:34:52,000
Do you understand what that means?

480
00:34:53,150 --> 00:34:54,984
Rites are made
for those with understanding,

481
00:34:55,039 --> 00:34:56,840
while punishments
are meant for the ignorant.

482
00:34:57,599 --> 00:34:59,519
An ignorant commoner like you

483
00:34:59,800 --> 00:35:01,719
has no right
to lecture me about the law.

484
00:35:04,239 --> 00:35:06,159
Of course there is law in this land.

485
00:35:08,079 --> 00:35:10,079
I am the law to you.

486
00:35:13,128 --> 00:35:14,590
My daughter is talking nonsense.

487
00:35:14,712 --> 00:35:16,190
I failed to teach her properly.

488
00:35:16,639 --> 00:35:17,360
I am at fault.

489
00:35:28,320 --> 00:35:29,360
Xu Lanxiang.

490
00:35:33,679 --> 00:35:34,320
You...

491
00:35:37,768 --> 00:35:39,192
If Dai Sheng and Ban Gu knew

492
00:35:39,240 --> 00:35:42,030
this was how you interpreted
the Book of Rites and Baihu Tongyi,

493
00:35:42,872 --> 00:35:44,800
they would surely
come knocking at midnight

494
00:35:45,039 --> 00:35:46,679
to teach you how to behave.

495
00:35:54,199 --> 00:35:55,280
Ladies,

496
00:35:55,559 --> 00:35:57,719
please follow me to see the Crown Prince.

497
00:35:57,720 --> 00:35:58,888
(Wang Cheng,
Attendant to the Crown Prince)

498
00:36:15,320 --> 00:36:18,360
I never expected this to be one
of Fengtai's romantic entanglements.

499
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:20,760
If I'd known, I would've made him stay.

500
00:36:26,159 --> 00:36:27,880
It was all my reckless doing.

501
00:36:28,024 --> 00:36:29,784
My father had nothing to do with it.

502
00:36:30,519 --> 00:36:31,760
Please punish me, Your Highness.

503
00:36:34,239 --> 00:36:36,519
Today is Chengze's wedding day.

504
00:36:36,800 --> 00:36:37,840
You're a guest, too.

505
00:36:38,599 --> 00:36:40,159
Go back and enjoy the play.

506
00:36:40,952 --> 00:36:42,840
Tomorrow, report
to the Ministry of Justice

507
00:36:43,199 --> 00:36:44,400
and turn yourself in.

508
00:36:44,504 --> 00:36:46,392
You will be dealt
with according to the law.

509
00:36:53,208 --> 00:36:55,016
Thank you for your mercy, Your Highness.

510
00:36:55,224 --> 00:36:57,976
Thank you for upholding justice
for me, Your Highness.

511
00:37:15,039 --> 00:37:15,880
Duke Xianguo.

512
00:37:16,280 --> 00:37:17,320
You may rise as well.

513
00:37:18,280 --> 00:37:19,480
The guests are all waiting.

514
00:37:19,880 --> 00:37:21,599
It's time for me
to change into my costume.

515
00:37:23,039 --> 00:37:24,760
Go back and watch the play.

516
00:37:25,280 --> 00:37:28,239
Think carefully about what justice
and righteousness truly mean.

517
00:37:28,719 --> 00:37:29,280
I

518
00:37:29,880 --> 00:37:30,960
shall obey Your Highness.

519
00:37:51,119 --> 00:37:51,920
Duke Xianguo.

520
00:37:52,320 --> 00:37:53,199
Let's go back.

521
00:38:18,400 --> 00:38:19,920
The play has already started.

522
00:38:20,519 --> 00:38:21,840
Why are you still here?

523
00:38:22,559 --> 00:38:24,960
Don't you want to see my performance?

524
00:38:25,079 --> 00:38:27,320
I was worried
Your Highness might summon me.

525
00:38:32,719 --> 00:38:47,480
♪My resentment cannot be quelled♪

526
00:38:56,400 --> 00:39:05,679
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

527
00:39:12,900 --> 00:39:19,900
(Bring Honor to Forebears
and Prosperity to Descendants)

528
00:39:20,260 --> 00:39:21,850
(Zheng Yun, Zheng Baichuan's Second Son)

529
00:39:21,864 --> 00:39:24,060
(Fifth-Rank Patrol Officer
of the Rear Military Command)

530
00:39:41,880 --> 00:39:43,230
No need to see me off, Butler Fu.

531
00:39:43,920 --> 00:39:45,159
Take care, Commander Lin.

532
00:39:47,880 --> 00:39:49,360
We're here to escort the bride.

533
00:39:49,599 --> 00:39:50,920
Take care, Commander Liu.

534
00:39:50,960 --> 00:39:51,679
I can still drink.

535
00:39:51,719 --> 00:39:53,039
Take care, Squad Leader Sun.

536
00:39:59,039 --> 00:39:59,800
Wait.

537
00:40:03,280 --> 00:40:04,079
Liu Xiaochuan.

538
00:40:04,152 --> 00:40:05,976
Don't you dare throw up in my carriage.

539
00:40:07,559 --> 00:40:08,519
Sorry.

540
00:40:10,119 --> 00:40:11,130
Did I say you could leave?

541
00:40:11,140 --> 00:40:12,870
A good dog knows
when to get out of the way!

542
00:40:12,880 --> 00:40:13,679
You...

543
00:40:14,119 --> 00:40:14,880
Yun.

544
00:40:14,880 --> 00:40:15,840
Come.

545
00:40:16,440 --> 00:40:17,239
Sorry.

546
00:40:17,912 --> 00:40:19,400
He's had too much to drink.

547
00:40:19,519 --> 00:40:20,990
He didn't recognize you.

548
00:40:21,000 --> 00:40:21,980
For the sake of the Yuan

549
00:40:22,110 --> 00:40:23,752
and Lin families'
joyous occasion today,

550
00:40:24,119 --> 00:40:25,000
please let this go.

551
00:40:25,760 --> 00:40:26,920
When he sobers up tomorrow,

552
00:40:27,016 --> 00:40:28,500
I'll have him host a proper banquet

553
00:40:28,510 --> 00:40:29,768
and make a proper apology.

554
00:40:30,232 --> 00:40:32,150
For the Crown Prince's safety,
everyone entering

555
00:40:32,184 --> 00:40:34,070
or leaving here
must be thoroughly searched.

556
00:40:35,128 --> 00:40:36,670
Anyone who refuses to cooperate

557
00:40:37,079 --> 00:40:38,400
is to be arrested immediately.

558
00:40:38,679 --> 00:40:39,519
Yes.

559
00:40:39,639 --> 00:40:40,000
Yes.

560
00:40:41,800 --> 00:40:44,360
But for Commander Lin's sake today,

561
00:40:45,079 --> 00:40:46,880
I'll let them off for now.

562
00:40:48,639 --> 00:40:49,440
Thank you, Yun.

563
00:40:50,000 --> 00:40:50,480
Thank you.

564
00:40:51,840 --> 00:40:54,159
Then we won't keep you
from your official duties.

565
00:40:54,440 --> 00:40:55,320
We'll be on our way.

566
00:40:55,510 --> 00:40:56,808
Let's meet another day.

567
00:41:16,719 --> 00:41:20,599
- Good!
- Good!

568
00:41:21,480 --> 00:41:24,239
♪The mirror of justice
shines through the ages♪

569
00:41:24,599 --> 00:41:28,840
♪All schemes shall come to nothing♪

570
00:41:30,239 --> 00:41:31,719
♪In this court♪

571
00:41:31,719 --> 00:41:34,239
♪State your name♪

572
00:41:34,599 --> 00:41:37,280
♪I am the Mountain Deity♪

573
00:41:38,719 --> 00:41:43,119
♪Everything you have done
has come before my eyes♪

574
00:41:43,599 --> 00:41:46,440
♪Guo Qiu abuses his power♪

575
00:41:46,719 --> 00:41:50,599
♪And commits evil deeds,
earning everyone's hatred♪

576
00:41:57,360 --> 00:41:59,639
♪Today I have descended
from the mountain♪

577
00:41:59,920 --> 00:42:03,000
♪To clear Tanniang's name♪

578
00:42:03,360 --> 00:42:06,079
♪What say you?♪

579
00:42:06,599 --> 00:42:10,320
♪The Mountain Deity's
will shall be obeyed♪

580
00:42:10,400 --> 00:42:13,320
♪Guards, release Tanniang at once♪

581
00:42:13,480 --> 00:42:14,719
♪Take Guo Qiu away♪

582
00:42:20,719 --> 00:42:21,400
Your Highness!

583
00:42:22,440 --> 00:42:23,440
Protect His Highness!

584
00:42:27,760 --> 00:42:28,599
What's going on?

585
00:42:32,280 --> 00:42:33,119
Guards, quickly!

586
00:42:35,559 --> 00:42:37,000
Your Highness! Protect His Highness!

587
00:42:39,119 --> 00:42:39,960
Move aside!

588
00:42:57,800 --> 00:42:58,719
Zheng Baichuan!

589
00:42:59,880 --> 00:43:01,039
Are you rebelling?

590
00:43:04,980 --> 00:43:07,420
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

591
00:43:08,920 --> 00:43:11,800
By the Mandate of Heaven, the Emperor

592
00:43:12,159 --> 00:43:13,239
hereby decrees.

593
00:43:13,840 --> 00:43:17,079
Lin Jinqi, Commander
of the Shence Garrison,

594
00:43:17,120 --> 00:43:18,408
has served the realm with loyalty

595
00:43:18,424 --> 00:43:20,890
and rendered meritorious service
in protecting the Emperor.

596
00:43:21,159 --> 00:43:22,760
As he has reached the age of marriage,

597
00:43:23,440 --> 00:43:25,840
a virtuous lady
shall be chosen as his wife.

598
00:43:26,000 --> 00:43:29,039
Xu, daughter of Xu Wanquan,

599
00:43:29,360 --> 00:43:31,039
is gentle and kind,

600
00:43:31,719 --> 00:43:33,440
virtuous and accomplished.

601
00:43:34,039 --> 00:43:36,199
To bring about this worthy union,

602
00:43:36,840 --> 00:43:40,039
she is hereby bestowed
in marriage to Lin Jinqi.

603
00:43:59,100 --> 00:44:03,220
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

604
00:44:06,060 --> 00:44:10,580
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

605
00:44:11,860 --> 00:44:15,780
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

606
00:44:16,460 --> 00:44:19,220
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

607
00:44:19,940 --> 00:44:22,260
♪Though all the world may fade♪

608
00:44:22,260 --> 00:44:25,340
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

609
00:44:26,860 --> 00:44:31,100
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

610
00:44:34,020 --> 00:44:38,180
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

611
00:44:39,980 --> 00:44:43,540
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

612
00:44:43,540 --> 00:44:47,100
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

613
00:44:47,900 --> 00:44:53,580
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

614
00:44:53,940 --> 00:44:58,260
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

615
00:44:58,620 --> 00:45:01,580
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

616
00:45:01,580 --> 00:45:05,340
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

617
00:45:05,340 --> 00:45:08,220
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

618
00:45:08,220 --> 00:45:12,300
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

619
00:45:12,300 --> 00:45:15,660
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

620
00:45:15,660 --> 00:45:19,420
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

621
00:45:19,420 --> 00:45:23,420
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

